@title Van fleet replacement: diesel, hybrid or electric
@subtitle Sunrise Bakery Co., for the budget meeting on 2026-11-10

Sunrise Bakery Co. replaces its 18 delivery vans over the next two years. This page compares the three options on five-year cost and operations.

## Options

grid 3

**Diesel.** Lowest purchase price, at $41,000 a van. Highest fuel and maintenance costs.

**Hybrid.** $46,500 a van, with lower fuel costs than diesel. No range worries, but it still produces tailpipe emissions.

**Electric.** $58,200 after the $7,500 incentive, plus $4,200 for charger installation. Lowest running costs, but its range is tight on our longest routes in January.

## Five-year cost

Per van, in dollars. Each total is the purchase price plus five years of running costs.

